"description":"Aloe Care’s award-winning service keeps older adults safer and helps caregivers stay connected and supported.\n\nDownload the Aloe Care app to install, pair and effortlessly connect to the elders' secure Aloe Care Smart Hub. The app also shows location and emergency updates if elders have the Aloe Care Mobile Companion (works nationwide on AT&T LTE where available.)\n\nYou and the people you choose to include in the circle of care can see vital information about the older adults well-being including falls, motion, air quality, and temperature -- all are detected by the Smart Hub and the Smart Activity Sensors and are shown in the app. The service provides 24/7 in-app access to support, including a professional emergency response center and collaborative care with your family and/or professional agencies.\n\nAlso use the app to check-in with elders through their Aloe Care Smart Hub. Through a voice command or push of a button on the Smart Hub, the older adult can also request your attention - you'll be notified within the app.\n\nThe secure Aloe Care app provides a comprehensive suite of caregiving tools:\n- Receive requests from the older adult for check-in/assistance\n- A log of check-ins by family and caregivers; participants can provide notes about the older adults’ status\n- Should an emergency occur, Aloe Care’s call center can be reached 24/7, either through a single button-push within the app or voice-activation from the elders' home\n- In-home and outdoor temperatures are visible; anomalies such as sudden spikes or drops are flagged\n- Get notice of marked changes in air quality conditions, including VOC and CO2 levels\n- Know exactly when professional caregivers arrive and depart\n- To help identify issues before they become emergencies, the Aloe Care sensors learn mobility patterns - mobility anomalies are noted within the app\n\nAloe Care’s award-winning service has been acclaimed by Real Simple, PCMag, Today's Caregiver, and MD Tech Review, among others. It was named Health & Wellness Product of the Year by the IoT Breakthrough Awards (2021). Aloe Care was created by caregivers, for caregivers. More than 70 percent of the people in the company actively support aging-in-place parents and grandparents.", "trackCensoredName":"Aloe Care Health", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/aloe-care-health/id1467385415?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4, "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":14}, 
