"description":"Find the whole-person care services you need and manage your family’s health information anytime, anywhere. With the AdventHealth app, you can:\n• Find a provider who meets your preferences and schedule or change in-person and video visits.\n• Join a waitlist for an earlier appointment and access virtual urgent care 24 hours a day, seven days a week.\n• View test results, medications, past visits, hospital stays and other health information.\n• Message your care team, connect with an AdventHealth Care Advocate, or chat with Emmie, your virtual assistant.\n• Review cost estimates before care and securely pay your medical bills.\n• Choose when and with whom to share your medical records.\n• Connect records from other healthcare organizations for a more complete view of your health.\n• Receive alerts when new information is available and manage your communication preferences.\n• Request prayer and spiritual support as part of AdventHealth’s faith-based approach to whole-person care.\n\nDownload the AdventHealth app to stay connected to your care and take your next step toward feeling whole, wherever you are.", "trackCensoredName":"AdventHealth", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/adventhealth/id1468538150?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.61268000000000011340262062731198966503143310546875, "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":24961}, 
