"description":"Quality care shouldn't be a privilege. Mochi Health is an online telehealth marketplace where you choose your doctor, your pharmacy, and your treatment — all under one transparent, flat-rate membership. No middlemen. No hidden fees. No waiting.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n  1. Complete a short health intake on your own schedule\n  2. Choose a board-certified provider by specialty and background\n  3. Get a personalized care plan — GLP-1, skincare, hair loss, nutrition, and more\n  4. Message your doctor or care team anytime. 24/7 support included\n\n\"I’ve had a really good experience with Mochi Health so far. The process is straightforward, communication is consistent, and everything feels organized and professional. I didn’t feel lost or confused at any point, which is a big deal when it comes to online healthcare. From ordering to delivery, everything has been reliable, and I feel supported without it being overwhelming. It’s convenient, efficient, and honestly takes a lot of stress out of managing things on my own.\" \n-Verified App Store Review\n\nWEIGHT LOSS\nAccess weight loss medication — prescribed by licensed US doctors and shipped directly to your door. 50% of Mochi patients lose at least 10% of their body weight within six months. Fixed pricing. No surprise fees when your dose increases.\n· Compounded semaglutide injection (once-weekly)\n\nSKINCARE\nPersonalized treatments formulated for your skin, not a one-size-fits-all shelf product.\n· Acne & breakout treatments\n· Anti-aging & retinoid formulas\n· Hyperpigmentation & melasma creams\n· Rosacea management\n\nHAIR LOSS\nPrescription-strength treatments for hair thinning and loss, reviewed by licensed providers who take the full picture into account.\n· Topical minoxidil & finasteride\n· Oral hair loss medications\n· Scalp treatment formulas\n\nMENOPAUSE\nFind relief from perimenopause and menopause symptoms: hot flashes, night sweats, low libido, and hormonal shifts. Mochi also supports women navigating PCOS and hormonal imbalances that are too often dismissed elsewhere.\n· Hormone replacement therapy (HRT)\n· Estradiol patches & topicals\n· Progesterone support\n· PCOS & hormonal imbalance treatment\n\nMENTAL HEALTH\nPersonalized treatment plans for anxiety, depression, and stress management. Fully online with ongoing provider support.\n· Anxiety & depression medication management\n· Ongoing provider messaging & check-ins\n· Personalized care plans\n\nLONGEVITY\nExplore treatments designed to help you understand and optimize your long-term health.\n· NAD+ therapy (injections & nasal spray)\n· Peptide treatments\n· Wearables integration\n\nSEXUAL HEALTH\nAccess treatments for erectile dysfunction, low libido, and other sexual health concerns. Discreetly, affordably, and without the waiting room.\n· Erectile dysfunction medication\n· Low libido & hormone support\n· Discreet, direct-to-door delivery\n\nThousands of medications, delivered. Compare pharmacies by medication, turnaround time, and ratings. Access GLP-1 treatments, skincare medications, and more. All shipped directly to your door. Switch pharmacies whenever you want.\n\nEverything in one place. Manage your care, talk to your provider, and order medication. All from the Mochi Health app. Available in all 50 states. Join Mochi today.\n\nAll professional medical services are provided by licensed physicians and clinicians affiliated with independently owned and operated professional practices.", "trackCensoredName":"Mochi Health: Weight Loss Care", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mochi-health-weight-loss-care/id6479331846?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.915919999999999845385900698602199554443359375, "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":17863}, 
